{
    "cells": [
        {
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "source": [
                "# <ctx>title</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "This is a comprehensive test of all features supported by the PyAct engine, including Python context injection and standard Markdown formatting.\n",
                "\n",
                "## 1. Context Variables\n",
                "Author: **<ctx>author</ctx>**\n",
                "Generated on: *<ctx>date</ctx>*\n",
                "\n",
                "## 2. LaTeX Equations via Python\n",
                "We can define complex mathematical formulas in Python and dynamically convert them to LaTeX:\n",
                "<ctx>math_formula</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "## 3. Dynamically Generated Tables\n",
                "Tables can be dynamically constructed from Python lists and injected into the document seamlessly:\n",
                "<ctx>user_table</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "## 4. Lists & Checklists\n",
                "### Ordered List:\n",
                "<ctx>o_list</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "### Unordered List:\n",
                " <ctx>u_list</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "### Checklist:\n",
                "<ctx>c_list</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "## 5. Media & Links\n",
                "Here is an injected hyperlink: <ctx>link</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "And here is a dynamically generated image with a caption:\n",
                "<ctx>hero_image</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "## 6. Footnotes\n",
                "This statement requires a citation.<ctx>footnote_ref</ctx>\n",
                "\n",
                "---\n",
                "<ctx>footnote_def</ctx>\n"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
            "source": [
                "import pamd_helpers\n",
                "from datetime import datetime\n",
                "\n",
                "def context():\n",
                "    # 1. LaTeX Equation Generation\n",
                "    from pyact.py2tex import py2tex\n",
                "    eq_str = '(x**2 - 4) / 2'\n",
                "    val = (5**2 - 4) / 2\n",
                "    eq = f'$$ f(x) = {py2tex(eq_str)} = {val} $$'\n",
                "    \n",
                "    headers = [\"Name\", \"Role\", \"Department\"]\n",
                "    rows = [\n",
                "        [\"Alice Smith\", \"Engineer\", \"R&D\"],\n",
                "        [\"Bob Jones\", \"Designer\", \"UX\"],\n",
                "        [\"Charlie Brown\", \"Manager\", \"Sales\"]\n",
                "    ]\n",
                "    user_table = pamd_helpers.table(headers, rows, \"Employee Roster\", add_no=True)\n",
                "    \n",
                "    ordered = pamd_helpers.ordered_list([\"Initialize engine\", \"Parse markdown\", \"Compile output\"])\n",
                "    unordered = pamd_helpers.unordered_list([\"Apples\", \"Bananas\", \"Cherries\"])\n",
                "    checklist = pamd_helpers.checklist([\"Write tests\", \"Refactor code\", \"Update README\"])\n",
                "    \n",
                "    link = pamd_helpers.hyperlink(\"PyAct GitHub Repository\", \"https://github.com/yourusername/pyact\")\n",
                "    img = pamd_helpers.image(\"https://picsum.photos/400/200\", \"A beautiful random landscape\")\n",
                "    \n",
                "    fn = pamd_helpers.Footnote(1, \"This is the footnote definition that explains the citation.\")\n",
                "    \n",
                "    return {\n",
                "        \"title\": \"PyAct Comprehensive Feature Test\",\n",
                "        \"author\": \"Radek\",\n",
                "        \"date\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n",
                "        \"math_formula\": eq,\n",
                "        \"user_table\": user_table,\n",
                "        \"o_list\": ordered,\n",
                "        \"u_list\": unordered,\n",
                "        \"c_list\": checklist,\n",
                "        \"link\": link,\n",
                "        \"hero_image\": img,\n",
                "        \"footnote_ref\": fn.adnotation(),\n",
                "        \"footnote_def\": fn.define_string()\n",
                "    }\n"
            ]
        }
    ]
}
